                   <property name="toolTip">
                    <string>Lookup table (CSV or TXT), one row per category of the input layer:
- Mapping field: the column whose values match the categories of the input layer.
- Class field: the mHM land cover class: 1 forest, 2 impervious (sealed), 3 pervious.
Columns starting with * are ignored; a [unit] suffix in a column name is allowed.

Example:
CODE,NAME,MHM_CLASS
311,Broad-leaved forest,1
111,Continuous urban fabric,2
211,Non-irrigated arable land,3</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="accessibleName">
