- Mapping field: the column whose values match the categories of the input layer.
- Class field: the mHM LAI class ID.
- LAND-USE: the class name.
- Jan, Feb, ..., Dec: the monthly leaf area index.
Columns starting with * are ignored; a [unit] suffix in a column name is allowed.

Example:
ID,LAND-USE,Jan,Feb,Mar,Apr,May,Jun,Jul,Aug,Sep,Oct,Nov,Dec,LAI_CLASS
1,Coniferous-forest,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,11,1
2,Deciduous-forest,0.5,0.5,1.5,4,7,11,12,12,11,8,1.5,0.5,2</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="accessibleName">
                    <string>LAI lookup table</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="styleSheet">
                    <string notr="true">QToolButton { color: palette(link); }</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="text">
                    <string>i</string>
                   </property>
                  </widget>
                 </item>
