                 <string>One discharge table per gauge (CSV or TXT; comma, semicolon, tab or | separated):
- a date column (date, time, datetime, timestamp, ...),
  or year, month and day columns (hour and minute optional);
- a discharge column (q, qobs, discharge, streamflow, flow, value, ...) in m3/s.
Empty, NULL, negative, -999 and -9999 values are missing data.
A GRDC export or a table layer loaded in QGIS works as well.

Example:
date,discharge
1990-01-01,12.4
1990-01-02,11.9</string>
